<p class="hygen-product__lede">
  The Girded Tote is designed as an everyday companion—functional, structured, and quietly expressive. Crafted entirely by hand from full vegetable-tanned horse culatta, it celebrates the raw beauty of the material through its natural grain, scars, and character.
</p>
{% render 'hygen-product-lead-time', product: product, style: 'detail' %}

